# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Netlify response headers.
#
# ⚠️ LAUNCH SWITCH — delete the X-Robots-Tag block below when the real domain
# goes live. While the site lives on a *.netlify.app preview URL it must stay
# out of Google: the pages name the production domain as their canonical, and
# an indexed preview would compete with the real site later.
#
# Everything else here is safe to keep.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

/*
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
